{"title": "Hailey Robertson", "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div class=\"druid-infobox druid-container noexcerpt\" id=\"druid-container-1\"><div><div class=\"druid-title\">Hailey Robertson</div></div><div class=\"druid-section-container\"><div class=\"druid-main-image\"><div class=\"druid-main-images-labels druid-tabs\"><div class=\"druid-main-images-label druid-tab druid-toggleable druid-title-tab focused\" data-druid=\"1-1\" data-druid-tab-key=\"In-Game\">In-Game</div></div><a href=\"/wiki/File:RubberRoomsHaileyChase.jpg\" class=\"image\"><img alt=\"RubberRoomsHaileyChase.jpg\" src=\"/images/thumb/RubberRoomsHaileyChase.jpg/250px-RubberRoomsHaileyChase.jpg?80520b\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"250\" height=\"141\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/RubberRoomsHaileyChase.jpg/375px-RubberRoomsHaileyChase.jpg?80520b 1.5x, /images/thumb/RubberRoomsHaileyChase.jpg/500px-RubberRoomsHaileyChase.jpg?80520b 2x\" data-file-width=\"1920\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div></div><div class=\"druid-section-container\"><div data-druid-section=\"Information\"><div class=\"druid-section druid-section-Information\">Information</div></div><div class=\"druid-row druid-row-VariantOf\" data-druid-section-row=\"Information\"><div class=\"druid-label druid-label-VariantOf\">Variant Of</div><div class=\"druid-data druid-data-VariantOf druid-data-nonempty\">\nGhost Girl</div></div><div class=\"druid-row druid-row-InternalID\" data-druid-section-row=\"Information\"><div class=\"druid-label druid-label-InternalID\">Internal ID</div><div class=\"druid-data druid-data-InternalID druid-data-nonempty\">\nHaileyEnemy</div></div><div class=\"druid-row druid-row-MaxCount\" data-druid-section-row=\"Information\"><div class=\"druid-label druid-label-MaxCount\">Max Count</div><div class=\"druid-data druid-data-MaxCount druid-data-nonempty\">\n1</div></div><div class=\"druid-row druid-row-PowerLevel\" data-druid-section-row=\"Information\"><div class=\"druid-label druid-label-PowerLevel\">Power Level</div><div class=\"druid-data druid-data-PowerLevel druid-data-nonempty\">\n2</div></div><div class=\"druid-row druid-row-CauseofDeath\" data-druid-section-row=\"Information\"><div class=\"druid-label druid-label-CauseofDeath\">Cause of Death</div><div class=\"druid-data druid-data-CauseofDeath druid-data-nonempty\">\nUnknown</div></div><div class=\"druid-row druid-row-IsBodyRecoverable\" data-druid-section-row=\"Information\"><div class=\"druid-label druid-label-IsBodyRecoverable\">Is Body Recoverable?</div><div class=\"druid-data druid-data-IsBodyRecoverable druid-data-nonempty\">\nYes</div></div></div><div class=\"druid-section-container\"><div data-druid-section=\"Stats\"><div class=\"druid-section druid-section-Stats\">Stats</div></div><div class=\"druid-row druid-row-Health\" data-druid-section-row=\"Stats\"><div class=\"druid-label druid-label-Health\">Health</div><div class=\"druid-data druid-data-Health druid-data-nonempty\">\nUnkillable</div></div><div class=\"druid-row druid-row-Damage\" data-druid-section-row=\"Stats\"><div class=\"druid-label druid-label-Damage\">Damage</div><div class=\"druid-data druid-data-Damage druid-data-nonempty\">\nInstant Kill</div></div><div class=\"druid-row druid-row-DoorSpeedMultiplier\" data-druid-section-row=\"Stats\"><div class=\"druid-label druid-label-DoorSpeedMultiplier\">Door Speed Multiplier</div><div class=\"druid-data druid-data-DoorSpeedMultiplier druid-data-nonempty\">\nIrrelevant</div></div><div class=\"druid-row druid-row-StunTimeMultiplier\" data-druid-section-row=\"Stats\"><div class=\"druid-label druid-label-StunTimeMultiplier\">Stun Time Multiplier</div><div class=\"druid-data druid-data-StunTimeMultiplier druid-data-nonempty\">\nImmune</div></div></div></div>\n<p><b>Hailey Robertson</b>, also referred to as just <b>Hailey</b>, is a hostile entity and variant of the <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://lethal.miraheze.org/wiki/Ghost_Girl\">Ghost Girl</a> added by <b>Wesley's Ememy Variants</b>. She resides in a coffin that opens to reveal her decayed corpse. She has hollowed out eyes, blonde hair, and a short blue dress.\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\".3E_Mechanics\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"&gt;_Mechanics\">&gt; Mechanics</span></h2>\n<p>There is little to no difference between the Ghost Girl and <b>Haily Robertson</b>. She will appear behind her targeted player accompanied by the sound of her coffin creaking, muffling the player's audio if they look at her. After her targeted player has looked at her at least twice or ignored her at least three times, approaching, looking, or staring at her can cause her to begin chasing that player. She will decapitate and instantly kill that player on contact.\n</p><p>While <b>Hailey Robertson</b> does have some possibly intentional instances of not being harmful to the player, such as her coffin showing up directly in the ship, she can be quite buggy. For example, she can sometimes get stuck and be visible moving in place on the exterior while trying to go after her targeted player. That said, it's better to be cautious when seeing her over assuming she is harmless.\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\".3E_Spawn_Conditions\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"&gt;_Spawn_Conditions\">&gt; Spawn Conditions</span></h2>\n<p><b>Hailey Robertson</b> will begin haunting the player that picked up any of the <a href=\"/wiki/Rubber_Rooms#Rewards\" title=\"Rubber Rooms\"><b>Secondary Objective Rewards</b></a> from the <b>Rubber Rooms</b>. Spooky sound effects will randomly be played followed by a message next to the player's stamina bar, which is <b>Hailey Robertson</b> speaking to them. This haunting persists across all moons barring moons like <a href=\"/wiki/Galetry\" title=\"Galetry\"><b>Galetry</b></a> and <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://lethal.miraheze.org/wiki/Gordion\">Gordion</a>.\n</p><p>Eventually, <b>Hailey Robertson</b> will announce her prescence with the player's screen turning red and getting a fear effect. This action spawns her as an entity. She will disappear upon returning to orbit. However, she can spawn once per reward grabbed and continue haunting players if multiple rewards are picked up. This can also apply if players pick up a medallion again after dropping it in the ship, typically after the save file is reloaded.\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\".3E_Journal_Entry\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"&gt;_Journal_Entry\">&gt; Journal Entry</span></h2>\n<p>After <b>Hailey Robertson</b> first spawns on a save file, players will receive this entry about her.\n</p>\n<table class=\"article-table mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" data-expandtext=\"\u25bc\" data-collapsetext=\"\u25b2\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<th>Hailey <span style=\"padding-left:0.5em;\">&#x2060;</span>\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>\n<table style=\"border: 15px solid #8E8E83; font-size: 135%; font-family: Tomorrow; color: #01A801; border-spacing: 0px;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"padding: 25px; background-color: #151515;\">HAILEY ROBERTSON<br /><br />First name: Hailey<br />Last name: Robertson<br />Middle name: -<br /><br />Gender: F<br />Age: 32<br /><br />Occupation: Nurse<br />Establishment: Crosswind Mental Hospital<br />Place: Last Hope<br /><br />Cause of death: Poisoning<br /><br />Hailey Robertson was found deceased in the treatment room of the Crosswind Mental Hospital, She had signs of physical abuse, lacerations to the back and chest, and a small hole was discovered in her forehead.<br /><br />A notebook was recovered from a burning bin containing a detailed log of the experiments she was put through. Among which were, being forcefully exposed to violent videos of human torture for days on end without breaks. Being suffocated to the edge of death causing minor brain damage. Having her solve complex logic puzzles within certain timeframes and being punished for failing.<br /><br />She was often reminded how her four year old son would not be able to survive without her as she was a single mother. This was with the promise of her being let go if she complied.<br />Unfortunately he also died of starvation during her capture.<br /><br />A tiny rod was used to destroy a small part of her brain which likely led to her losing any sort of self. This was one of the final experiments listed within the notebook.<br /><br />Hailey Robertson was one of many victims of such experiments and life altering treatments by the hands of Solover Underhill, the head psychiatrist of the Crosswind Mental Hospital.<br /><br />She was a loving, hard working mother who had a hard time following her husband\u2019s passing. She was full of courage and remained positive even during her hardest times.<br />She will be remembered by all.<br />May she Rest in Peace.<br /><br />\u2014-----------------------------------------<br /><br />She is here<br />She has a heart of vengeance<br />Do not disturb her\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<h2><span id=\".3E_Audio\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"&gt;_Audio\">&gt; Audio</span></h2>\n<div class=\"noresize\">\n<table class=\"wikitable sortable mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" style=\"text-align: center;\" data-expandtext=\"\u25bc\" data-collapsetext=\"\u25b2\">\n<caption style=\"white-space: nowrap;\">Audio\n</caption>\n<tbody><tr>\n<th>Action</th>\n<th>Sound\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Spawning</td>\n<td><audio controls=\"\" preload=\"none\" width=\"320\" style=\"width:320px;max-width:100%;max-height:100%\" data-durationhint=\"2\" data-mwtitle=\"CurseNoiseA14.mp3\" data-mwprovider=\"local\"><source src=\"/images/CurseNoiseA14.mp3?bf8a78\" type=\"audio/mpeg\" data-width=\"0\" data-height=\"0\" /><source src=\"/images/transcoded/CurseNoiseA14.mp3/CurseNoiseA14.mp3.ogg\" type=\"audio/ogg; codecs=&quot;vorbis&quot;\" data-transcodekey=\"ogg\" data-width=\"0\" data-height=\"0\" /></audio>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Appearing</td>\n<td><audio controls=\"\" preload=\"none\" width=\"320\" style=\"width:320px;max-width:100%;max-height:100%\" data-durationhint=\"23\" data-mwtitle=\"CoffinChime.mp3\" data-mwprovider=\"local\"><source src=\"/images/CoffinChime.mp3?b2091e\" type=\"audio/mpeg\" data-width=\"0\" data-height=\"0\" /><source src=\"/images/transcoded/CoffinChime.mp3/CoffinChime.mp3.ogg\" type=\"audio/ogg; codecs=&quot;vorbis&quot;\" data-transcodekey=\"ogg\" data-width=\"0\" data-height=\"0\" /></audio>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Creaking</td>\n<td><audio controls=\"\" preload=\"none\" width=\"320\" style=\"width:320px;max-width:100%;max-height:100%\" data-durationhint=\"15\" data-mwtitle=\"CoffinCreaking.mp3\" data-mwprovider=\"local\"><source src=\"/images/CoffinCreaking.mp3?aeb351\" type=\"audio/mpeg\" data-width=\"0\" data-height=\"0\" /><source src=\"/images/transcoded/CoffinCreaking.mp3/CoffinCreaking.mp3.ogg\" type=\"audio/ogg; codecs=&quot;vorbis&quot;\" data-transcodekey=\"ogg\" data-width=\"0\" data-height=\"0\" /></audio>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Bell Chime</td>\n<td><audio controls=\"\" preload=\"none\" width=\"320\" style=\"width:320px;max-width:100%;max-height:100%\" data-durationhint=\"22\" data-mwtitle=\"Bellchim2.mp3\" data-mwprovider=\"local\"><source src=\"/images/Bellchim2.mp3?d264d2\" type=\"audio/mpeg\" data-width=\"0\" data-height=\"0\" /><source src=\"/images/transcoded/Bellchim2.mp3/Bellchim2.mp3.ogg\" type=\"audio/ogg; codecs=&quot;vorbis&quot;\" data-transcodekey=\"ogg\" data-width=\"0\" data-height=\"0\" /></audio>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Curses</td>\n<td><audio controls=\"\" preload=\"none\" width=\"320\" style=\"width:320px;max-width:100%;max-height:100%\" data-durationhint=\"9\" data-mwtitle=\"CurseNoiseA1.mp3\" data-mwprovider=\"local\"><source src=\"/images/CurseNoiseA1.mp3?462ce7\" type=\"audio/mpeg\" data-width=\"0\" data-height=\"0\" /><source src=\"/images/transcoded/CurseNoiseA1.mp3/CurseNoiseA1.mp3.ogg\" type=\"audio/ogg; codecs=&quot;vorbis&quot;\" data-transcodekey=\"ogg\" data-widt